Linkpile
========

Linkpile is a small social bookmarking site. Keep your bookmarks
on the web instead of in one browser, tag them with simple words,
and see what other people are saving.

Features
--------

  * Save links with a title, notes and tags (separated by spaces)
  * A page for every user and every tag, with related tags
  * RSS 2.0 feeds for users, tags, and users plus tags
  * A bookmarklet to post the page you are looking at in one click
  * Tag cloud and a "popular this week" page
  * Tag suggestions while you type (XMLHttpRequest, no page reload!)

Requirements
------------

  * Apache 1.3 or 2.0
  * PHP 4.3 or newer (PHP 5 works too)
  * MySQL 4.0 or newer

See INSTALL for how to set it up and NEWS for what changed in
each release.

Files
-----

  index.php        recent bookmarks
  post.php         add and edit bookmarks
  delete.php       delete a bookmark
  user.php         one user's bookmarks
  tag.php          everything with one tag
  cloud.php        the tag cloud
  popular.php      popular this week
  rss.php          RSS 2.0 feeds
  bookmarklet.php  bookmarklet instructions
  suggest.php      tag suggestions for js/suggest.js
  register.php,
  login.php,
  logout.php       accounts
  inc/             header, footer and other included files
  css/             stylesheet
  js/              JavaScript
  sql/schema.sql   database tables
